# These need Kelly's approval before they reach main. The workflows define the required checks,
# signing and releasing. The tests, their config and the build tools and requirements run inside an
# approved signing run, so changing them could weaken the tests or reach the signing secrets.
# The app code in thechatplace/ runs there too (the tests import it) but isn't listed, so that
# collaborators can work on the app: what a release contains is checked when Kelly tags it.
# docs/ is published straight to the public GitHub Pages site.
